1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:01,330
(Howard:)Problem solved.

2
00:00:03,543 --> 00:00:06,083
(Bernadette:)No, it's not. I'm not going in there.

3
00:00:06,254 --> 00:00:09,674
(Howard:)Oh, come on, honey. She's just
sitting in there reading a magazine.

4
00:00:09,841 --> 00:00:12,431
(Howard:)You can't see anything.
I go in all the time.

5
00:00:14,178 --> 00:00:17,348
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Ha! The eagle has landed.

6
00:00:20,518 --> 00:00:23,148
And we have splash down.

7
00:00:25,565 --> 00:00:28,155
(Howard:)Wait here.
I'm gonna go light a candle.

8
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:31,650
(Howard:)And then we make passionate love.

9
00:00:38,369 --> 00:00:41,619
- There we go, last floor.
- I just can't figure out what happened.

10
00:00:41,789 --> 00:00:44,209
(Leonard:)I put my left leg in,
I took my left leg out.

11
00:00:44,375 --> 00:00:48,375
(Leonard:)I put my left leg in,
and something just snapped.

12
00:00:48,671 --> 00:00:51,381
The Hokey-Pokey
is a young man's game.

13
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:54,009
(Leonard:)I did have a great time.

14
00:00:54,177 --> 00:00:58,027
(Leonard:)Thank you for reminding me
it's okay to have fun once in a while.

